# .gitignore for Visual Studio, .NET, and C#
## Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
*.log

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vs/

## NuGet packages
*.nupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored if you use package restore
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
!**/packages/repositories.config

## Visual Studio Code workspace
.vscode/

## Rider
.idea/

## DotCover
*.dotCover

## Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

## ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

## Publish output
[Dd]ist/
[Pp]ublish/
*.pubxml
*.publishproj

## Others
*.dbmdl
*.pdb
*.cache
*.config
*.pidb
*.svclog
*.scc

## Entity Framework
Migrations/

## Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## npm packages
node_modules/

## Mac files
.DS_Store

## Windows image file caches
Thumbs.db

## Temporary files
~$*
*.tmp

# End of .gitignore